---
const faqs = [
  {
    question: "How do we communicate and stay organized?",
    answer:
      "I keep communication simple and transparent. Projects are organized with clear timelines, deliverables, and progress updates, with regular Loom updates, WhatsApp, and calls when important decisions need to be made.",
  },
  {
    question: "How do we start a project?",
    answer:
      "We begin with a short discovery call or message exchange to understand your goals and direction. From there, I define the scope and provide a tailored proposal. Approve the proposal, submit the initial project deposit, and we'll get started.",
  },
  {
    question: "How much does a project cost?",
    answer:
      "Most projects range from $800 to $2,400 USD, depending on the scope and complexity. A 50% deposit is required to get started, with the remaining balance due once the agreed scope is completed and you've had a chance to review the final website. I want you to feel confident in what we're building together, so reasonable refinements are part of the process.",
  },
  {
    question: "How long does a project take?",
    answer:
      "Most projects are completed within 2 to 4 weeks. Timelines vary depending on the scope, but I establish clear milestones from day one to keep everything on track.",
  },
  {
    question: "Do you offer support after launch?",
    answer:
      "Yes. I provide post-launch support to help with fixes, updates, and any issues that come up after the website goes live. Ongoing support can also be arranged depending on what you need.",
  },
];
---

<section
  id="faq"
  class="flex flex-col items-center px-5 pt-15 md:pt-20 pb-30 md:pb-50"
>
  <h2 class="mb-10 md:mb-20 text-3xl sm:text-6xl font-medium">FAQ</h2>

  <div class="w-full max-w-5xl">
      {faqs.map(({ question, answer }, index) => (
        <details
          class="faq-item group bg-transparent text-black transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-black hover:text-white"
          open={index === 0}
        >
          <summary
            class="flex w-full cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6 px-4 py-4 text-left [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"
          >
            <h3 class="font-archivo text-xl font-medium md:text-2xl">{question}</h3>

            <span class="relative block h-4 w-4 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-0.5 w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span>
              <span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-0.5 -translate-x-1/2 bg-current transition-transform duration-300 ease-out group-open:scale-y-0"></span>
            </span>
          </summary>

          <div class="min-h-0 overflow-hidden">
            <p class="max-w-4xl px-4 pb-5 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
              {answer}
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>
      ))}
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq-item::details-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: 0fr;
    opacity: 0;
    transition:
      grid-template-rows 380ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
      opacity 380ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
      content-visibility 380ms allow-discrete;
  }

  .faq-item[open]::details-content {
    grid-template-rows: 1fr;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .faq-item::details-content {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>